# FRONTEND .env — DEPRECATED. Please use the SINGLE ROOT ../.env file instead.
#
# All env vars for the whole project live in the repo root:
#     facial/
#       .env                                  <-- EDIT THIS ONE (copy from ../.env.example)
#       facial-recognition-dashboard/
#         .env.local.example                  <-- this file (info only)
#
# Frontend needs (see ../.env.example section 3 for full docs):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL  Render backend URL (e.g. https://your-app.onrender.com)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL   Render WS URL (e.g. wss://your-app.onrender.com)
#
# Local dev defaults:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:1223
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=ws://localhost:1223
#
# Why still works: next.config.mjs walks UP to ../.env automatically and
# exposes NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars through nextConfig.env so the client bundle
# picks them up correctly.
